---
import Base from "../../layouts/Base.astro";
import { CONTACT_EMAIL } from "../../lib/i18n";
---

<Base lang="en" altPath="/privacy" title="Privacy Policy — Promethena">
  <article class="legal prose">
    <a class="back" href="/en/">← Back to dock</a>
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="updated">Last updated: 2026-08-10</p>

    <h2>1. Summary</h2>
    <p>
      This Site is static — no server, no database, no account system. The operator does not
      separately collect or store personal data. This document exists to be transparent about
      what limited data flows can still happen.
    </p>

    <h2>2. Data kept only in your browser</h2>
    <p>
      The light/dark theme choice in the header is saved to your browser's local storage only. It
      is never sent to the operator's server and is removed if you clear your browser data. The
      Site does not use cookies, tracking scripts, or analytics.
    </p>

    <h2>3. Data shared with third parties</h2>
    <p>
      The wordmark font (Bebas Neue) is loaded from Google Fonts. Loading it may send your IP
      address and other connection details to Google's servers. See
      <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
        Google's Privacy Policy
      </a> for details.
    </p>
    <p>
      The Site is hosted on Cloudflare Pages. Like most hosting providers, basic access logs (IP,
      timestamp, requested path) may be kept briefly at the infrastructure level for security and
      operations; the operator does not separately collect or analyze this data.
    </p>

    <h2>4. If you email us</h2>
    <p>
      Clicking "Join waitlist" or "Inquire to buy" opens an email. Any name, email address, or
      message you send ends up in the operator's personal inbox and is used only to respond to
      you — never shared with third parties or used for marketing. To have it deleted, just ask
      via the same email.
    </p>

    <h2>5. Children's privacy</h2>
    <p>This Site is not directed at children and does not knowingly collect their personal data.</p>

    <h2>6. Your rights</h2>
    <p>
      If you've emailed the operator, you can request to see or delete that message at any time —
      contact us below.
    </p>

    <h2>7. Changes to this policy</h2>
    <p>
      If the Site later adds payments or accounts and starts collecting more data, this document
      will be updated to match. Changes take effect once posted here.
    </p>

    <h2>8. Contact</h2>
    <p>
      Privacy questions can be sent to <a href={`mailto:${CONTACT_EMAIL}`}>{CONTACT_EMAIL}</a>.
    </p>
  </article>
</Base>

<style>
  .legal {
    padding: 24px 0 60px;
  }
  .updated {
    color: var(--ink-dim);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.8rem;
  }
  .back {
    display: inline-block;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    color: var(--ink-dim);
    text-decoration: none;
  }
</style>
